What is needed to experience the theatre?
=========================================

o Telnet access to the Internet.
--------------------------------
      If you're reading this, then you've likely already met this requirement.
      If however, you don't have regular access and would like to find out how
      to get regular access to the Internet, call us at the number below, and 
      we can help you to find an Internet access provider.

o VT100 terminal emulation.
---------------------------
      Most systems are capable of this, to various degrees. Every major 
      communications capable product on the market provides this, including
      Windows, Internet-In-A-Box, NCSA Telnet and xterm. If your communications
      software does terminal emulation, you can expect VT100 is supported.

